{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/417","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/417/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/417/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/417/events","html_url":"https://github.com/google/ExoPlayer/issues/417","id":70767834,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWU3MDc2NzgzNA==","number":417,"title":"Allow processing of last output buffer in MediaCodecTrackRenderer drainOutputBuffer","user":{"login":"ptran-gpfw","id":3084650,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwODQ2NTA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3084650?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ptran-gpfw","html_url":"https://github.com/ptran-gpfw","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ptran-gpfw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ptran-gpfw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ptran-gpfw/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ptran-gpfw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ptran-gpfw/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ptran-gpfw/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ptran-gpfw/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ptran-gpfw/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ptran-gpfw/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":106814989,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMDY4MTQ5ODk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"fc2929","default":true,"description":null}],"state":"closed","locked":true,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":4,"created_at":"2015-04-24T18:54:22Z","updated_at":"2017-06-28T11:14:37Z","closed_at":"2015-06-26T14:17:51Z","author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"In my own usage of MediaCodec (separate from ExoPlayer) I have observed `dequeueOutputBuffer` return info on an output buffer that has both a) a valid buffer index and b) a flag bitfield that contains `MediaCodec.BUFFER_FLAG_END_OF_STREAM`.\n\nIn MediaCodecTrackRenderer `drainOutputBuffer` ([line 832](https://github.com/google/ExoPlayer/blob/dev/library/src/main/java/com/google/android/exoplayer/MediaCodecTrackRenderer.java#L832)), the detection of `BUFFER_FLAG_END_OF_STREAM` causes the method to return before the call to `processOutputBuffer`. This prevents processing of the last output buffer.\n","closed_by":{"login":"ojw28","id":7881572,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4ODE1NzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7881572?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28","html_url":"https://github.com/ojw28","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/417/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/417/timeline","performed_via_github_app